UID:fb9530023928987a8c084aa8@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us in this lively exploration of the first teaching of th
 e Buddha - the Four Noble Truths: dukkha (suffering or unsatisfactoriness)
 \, samudaya (its origin)\, nirodha (the cessation of suffering)\, marga (t
 he path leading to the cessation of suffering)'
